I think you misunderstood his question.  Crom and Odin are both
neutral, but for different characters (Crom for B and Odin for V).

The answer to the original question is "yes", the altars themselves
only have alignments, and they don't remember the name of the god.
Programmingly speaking, there is a function (something like
align_gname(alignment)) that returns the string of the name of the god
of the given alignment of the current character class.

So the same altar will be Odin's if you are a V, The Lady's if you are
a T, and Raiden's if you are a S.

